WEBVTT

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:03.600
Microsoft spans the computer on your desk

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.467
and the services behind your work.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.667
Windows runs the PC experience.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.067
Microsoft 365 supports documents,

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:13.100
communication, and collaboration.

00:00:13.233 --> 00:00:15.900
Azure supplies cloud computing, storage,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.200
and AI services for applications.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:20.000
Copilot adds AI assistance

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.867
across selected workflows.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.633
These are connected products,

00:00:23.633 --> 00:00:26.133
not a single system: what you can use depends

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:28.933
on the product, configuration, and subscription.
